# ACT4 (riscv-arch-test) scalar suites for the new core: the GA (pass/fail)
# and GL-C (final hash against test/golden/act/<ext>.final) gates.
# Images: test/hex/act_<ext>_<name>.hex, gitignored, built by `make -C test/act`
# (see test/act/README.md). Run with test/gates/run_act.py.
#
# Zicntr computes on cycle/instret values, which differ between cores (only the
# read itself is masked), so it is judged by pass/fail only; it runs with the
# retire-count mtime so its `time` reads stay deterministic.
# pmpsm cfg_A_tor_zero and cfg_tor_check_01..03 jump into code rewritten by
# a store without fence.i; which copy is fetched is implementation-defined,
# so they are judged by pass/fail only.

